        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, Bawīlage a bagabīji, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni gīkī, “Ngabīji ose ose ītang'wigeleelilwe kwisosohaja",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kwisosohaja:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūkuumya, nūūlū kwegeela ha mimba go ndimu, nūūlū go munhū, gwalī gūmò gwa mihayo ya kwenheleja munhū kūsosohala.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūlwa munhū ūyo wazumalīkaga, nūūlū akabiza wa kūfuma mu banhū bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Banhū bakwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hū kūhaya banhū ba kūfuma mu lūganda lwa Alooni, nūūlū a ba lūganda lwa bagabīji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Numho abize wa mu kaya gete, gītī nina, ise, ng'witūnja wakwe nūūlū nshīke wakwe, na kūlwa nzunaye nūūlū nkūlūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adūgije ū kwisosohaja nūūlū kūlwa nguno ya ng'wilūmbūye ūyo atatoolilwe, ūlū akanang'hanaga wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji ītang'wigeleelilwe kwisosohaja kūlwa nguno ya banhū ba kū būkwiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hama yaya kwihalūla ipala ha ntwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kwihalūla ipala ha ntwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī mihayo yenīyo ī shikū jenījo yītagwa mu mahanga ga banhū bingī kūlwa koolecha būpīna nguno ya kūchīlwa. A Baisilaeli, ī no no no a bagabīji, baalī balemejiwe ū kwīta ī yenīyo",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", nūūlū kūmoogeela ndezu mu mhelo mhelo; yaya nūūlū kwitema salago ha mīlī gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei īng'wigeleelilwe kūbiza ng'wela ū kūlī Mulungu wakwe, yaya ū kūlīsosohaja ī lina lya ng'wa Mulungu wakwe. Nguno alī ng'wenhi wa shilīwa ū kūlī Mulungu wakwe, alī na nīmo gwa kūfunya shitambò kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto; na lūūlū ū ngabīji shing'wigeleelilwe kūbiza ng'wela gete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Īkī ū ngabīji alī ng'wela ū kūlī Mulungu wakwe, na lūūlū atī wa kūtoola nkīma ng'wīmīlīzu, nūūlū ūyo wamala kūlaala na bagosha bangī, nūūlū wamala kūbūlaga numba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī munhū shiigeleelilwe ang'wisaabe ū ngabīji gīkī alī ng'wela, nguno akenhaga shilīwa kūlī Mulungu wing'we. Ng'wisaabagi ū ng'wenūyo gīkī alī ng'wela, nguno ū nene SEEBA nalī ng'wela; ū nene ūyo nakang'wītaga bing'we kūbiza beela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hama ūlū nshīke wa ngabīji wisosohaja wei ng'wenekīlī mu nzīla ya wīmīlīzu, akūbiza wansosohajaga ise; na lūūlū ū ng'wenūyo wigeleelilwe kūbūlagwa wa kūpemva mu moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū ngabīji ntaale mu baana ba ng'wawe, ūyo wamala kwitīīlwa maguta ha ntwe gwakwe kūlwa kūtūūlwa ha nīmo, hūna ūshikīlījiwa ho a ha nīmo, ūbiza wa kūyūzwaala nī shizwalo sha nyagabīji, ū ng'wenūyo yaya ū kūjilekanīja ī nzwīlī jakwe jisakaale; yaya nūūlū kūtandūla shizwalo shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atī wa kwegeela hose hose aho gūlī mimba; atī wa kwisosohaja nūūlū hado, nūūlū ni kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa ise nūūlū nina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei atī wa kwīnga na hado yaya ū ng'wipandī lyeela lya ng'wa Mulungu wakwe, yaya nūūlū kūlīsosohaja mu nzīla yose yose, nguno ū wei wamala kwejiwa kūlwa kwitīīlwa maguta ga ng'wa Mulungu wakwe; ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū nkīma wa kūtoolwa na ngabīji ntaale abize ataalī kūlaala na ngosha ūngī ose ose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei atī wa kūtoola nkīma wamala kūchīlwa, nūūlū wabūlaga numba, nūūlū ūyo wasosohajiwa wīmīlīzu; alīyo alī wa kūtoola nkīma wa kūfuma mu banhū bakwe, ūyo ataalī kūlaala na ngosha ose ose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji ntaale atigeleelilwe kūsosohaja būbyīle wakwe ū mu banhū bakwe. Ū nene nalī SEEBA, ūyo nakabīītaga bagabīji kūbiza beela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlemehazu mu bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīlage ū Alooni gīkī, “Ū mu shibyalīlwe shose īsho shiliza, nemehazu ose ose ū mu būbyīle wako, atigeleelilwe kwegeela kūlī Mulungu wakwe kūfunya shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ūyo alī na būlemehazu būlebe yaya ū kwegeela; mboku ose ose yaya, nūūlū nemehazu, nūūlū alī na būlema būlebe kū būshū,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Būlema būlebe kū būshū:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shose shose īsho shilī kū būtongi bo ntwe, nomo, nindo, miso, shilezu, nū būshū wenekīlī (ng'hangala jingī na a matama na a matū gakabalīlagwa ko).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nūūlū alī na gūgūlū gūmò, nūūlū nkono gūmò nīhu kūtinda ng'wichaago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abize abīnzīkile kūgūlū nūūlū nkono, nū ng'wene yaya ū kwegeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū wigembe ha ngongo, nūūlū nemehazu mu kakūlīle, nūūlū alī na songo, nūūlū wa būhele nūūlū malonda; nūūlū asoloolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
