            "sid": "LEV 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho wa būbyīle wa ngabīji Alooni ūyo alī na būlemehazu wa mbika yose yose ū wa kūzunīlījiwa kwegeela kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kwiza kūfunya shakwinha mu nzīla ya moto. Īkī alī na būlemehazu, na lūūlū atizegeela kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu wakwe kwenha shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī shilīwa īsho shikafunyiagwa kūlī Mulungu wakwe, ī sheela no no no, nī shingī īsho shikafunyiagwa, azunīlījiwe ū kūshilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyoī īkī alī na būlemehazu, atazunīlījiwe kwegeela a hisenge lya ng'wipandī lyeela, nūūlū ū kwegeela a ha ng'walīlo; nguno adūgije kūlīsosohaja ī lipandī lyeela lyane. Ū nene nalī SEEBA ūyo nakabīītaga bagabīji kūbiza beela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
